  "body": "Viewing By appointment Only\r\n\r\nJust a hop, skip and a jump from everything you need, right where you need it. Silverdale, Kingsway and Stella Maris schools are all within easy walking distance. Leave the car at home and stroll to cafés, supermarkets, medical facilities, restaurants and everyday conveniences. Coastal walks, cycleways, golf courses, Orewa Beach and motorway access are all just minutes from your front door.  \r\n\r\nThis beautifully presented Stables Lane townhouse offers a rare combination of style, security and low-maintenance living - ideal whether you're stepping onto the property ladder, upsizing from an apartment, running a busy career, raising a young family, or simply ready for a home that gives you your time back. Lock the door and head away for the weekend or travel for weeks at a time, secure in the knowledge it will be exactly as you left it - with no lawns or gardens to keep up.  \r\n\r\nInside, light-filled open-plan living, dining and a designer kitchen create a natural hub for everyday life and effortless entertaining, with a heat-pump to keep the temperature comfortable all year round. Step outside to your own private, North-facing sunny courtyard — perfect for a morning coffee or an evening wine, without the upkeep of a larger section.  This layout works for real life, with three bedrooms and two bathrooms giving you room to grow into - a home office, a nursery, a hobby space or somewhere for visiting family to stay - all without the maintenance of a bigger home.  \r\n\r\nQuality lock-up-and-leave homes like this in Millwater are tightly held - sought after by first-home buyers, professionals, young families and downsizers alike, all drawn to the same thing: more time, less upkeep.  \r\n\r\nIf you're ready for a home that fits your life rather than the other way around, this is well worth a look.",
